      <h1>InspectX: the QR-code-driven digital inspection system</h1>
      <p class="lead">InspectX is a web-based inspection platform for hazardous and industrial environments. It replaces paper-based inspections with a structured, digital process — scan the equipment, follow the guided checks, capture photo evidence and give management a clear view of compliance.</p>
